  Slug: way-of-the-spellshot
  DisplayName: Way of the Spellshot
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/classes/way-of-the-spellshot.webp
  Description: 'You''ve learned the intricacies of magic and technology, blending
    the two together with deadly results. You combine a knowledge of arcane theories
    with a strong connection to your chosen weapon that allows you to manifest unique
    effects, combining deadly skill with a firearm alongside an array of moderate
    spellcasting. You can imbue energy into your weapon and conjure bullets from
    thin air. As you progress, you eventually learn to phase bullets through walls
    or even to teleport yourself along the path of your bullets. You must select
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Spellshot Dedication] as your 2nd-level
    class feat. Prerequisites You must be a gunslinger. Spellshot Adjustments Instead
    of choosing a way from the options listed in the gunslinger class, you have the
    way of the spellshot. It has the following way skill, slinger''s reload, and
    deeds. You gain these abilities at the same levels as normal for the class. You
    use Intelligence for your class DC. Way Skill Arcana Slinger''s Reload @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Thoughtful
    Reload] Deeds Initial @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Energy Shot]; Advanced
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Recall Ammunition]; Greater @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Dispelling
    Bullet]'
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Guns & Gears
  SourcePack: classfeatures
